    "body": "here is my full `.gitconfig` just in case you wish to repro and test on your side,\r\n\r\n```gitconfig\r\n[user]\r\n    name = <NAME>\r\n    email = <EMAIL_ADDR>\r\n    signingkey = <HOME>/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub\r\n[core]\r\n    editor = nvim\r\n[color]\r\n    status = auto\r\n    branch = auto\r\n    interactive = auto\r\n    diff = auto\r\n[gpg]\r\n    format = ssh\r\n[commit]\r\n    gpgsign = true\r\n[gpg \"ssh\"]\r\n    allowedSignersFile = <HOME>/.ssh/allowed_signers\r\n[tag]\r\n    gpgsign = true\r\n[alias]\r\n    slog = log --graph --all --topo-order --pretty='format:%C(auto)%h %ai %C(always,brightgreen)%s%C(auto)%d (%an)'\r\n```",
